--- !u!114 &31136392
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 31136390}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38732f8ed70b08f86b6401a11fceb82d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.Broadcast
  roomId: R1
  lines:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_00
    text: '...in uniform for the first time this morning, a week after the vote.
      Japan has an army again, in name as well as in fact: the JSSDF.'
    picture: a parade under grey sky, new flags
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_01
    text: In Washington, the Pentagon sends a third carrier group to the region,
      and American forces stay on high alert.
    picture: a carrier at sea, aircraft on the deck
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_02
    text: It follows more reports that North Korea gave nuclear material to armed
      groups. Pyongyang denies it. None of the reports is confirmed.
    picture: a map of the region, the border drawn red
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_03
    text: Here at home, the police strike enters its fifth day. The union walked
      out over pay and pensions, and the talks broke down again last night.
    picture: a picket line in the snow, outside a precinct house
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_04
    text: The Guard holds the city in their place. Checkpoints now stand on the bridges
      and on the expressway. Expect delays into the city.
    picture: a Guard checkpoint on a bridge, a barrier, a line of cars
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_05
    text: The mayor calls it a season of patience. The shops on Market Street call
      it something else.
    picture: a shop window with its Christmas lights, an empty pavement
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_06
    text: The Guard says that the checkpoints stay through New Year's Eve, and the
      anniversary.
    picture: a checkpoint at night, the city lights behind it
  byBand:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_low
    text: 'Also overnight: an incident at the Winwood Reade Memorial. The motive
      is unknown.'
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, a patrol car
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_middle
    text: 'Also overnight: a shooter attacked the Winwood Reade Memorial. [N] people
      are dead. The motive is unknown.'
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, tape across them
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_high
    text: 'Also overnight: [N] people are dead after a shooter attacked the Winwood
      Reade Memorial. The motive is unknown, and no group has claimed it.'
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, tape, a line of ambulances
  closing:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_cut
    text: Police are asking citizens to be on the lookout for -
    picture: 
  doneFlag: demo_r1_news_done
  loop: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5783183b3f71a3f91911c014ba8e0d14, type: 3}
  loopVolume: 0.2
  pictures: {fileID: 31136393}
  afterComment: '[A music channel. A Christmas song, low.]'
